var e=[{id:`n_1`,type:`scene_change`,speaker:null,text:null,stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:null,R:null}}},{id:`n_2`,type:`dialog`,speaker:`ROI_PRYDWEN_NULL_CHANGE`,text:{KOREA:`하아. 애늙은이 꼬마에 겉멋든 아줌마를 피해 왔더니, 코가 꿰여 버렸네. 너, 다음부턴 사람 놀래키지 말고 귀띔이라도 해 줘. 알겠어?`,JPN:`チッ。大人気取りのチビやミーハーなオバサンの代わりに、こっちに捕まっちまったな。なあ、次からこういうことがある時は、予め教えてくれ。いいな？`,ENG:`Gah, just when I thought the old soul and the old lady had stopped nagging at me, this had to happen to chain me for life. Mate, let me know ahead of time if you want to talk to me about something like this again, alright? I don't like surprises.`,TWN:`切，我還以為以後不用聽長輩們的嘮叨了，這次真的是逃不掉了呢。以後有這種事情的話就早點告訴我吧，不要嚇到我啊。`},stage:{bg:`LIFETIME`,bg_animation:null,bgm:`CUTSCENE_HOPE`,filter:`NCFT_NORMAL`,slots:{L:null,C:{char_id:`ROI_PRYDWEN_NULL_CHANGE`,face:`UNIT_IDLE`,hologram:!1},R:null}}}];export{e as default};